---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout current="home">
<main class="w-full pt-20 bg-surface min-h-[calc(100vh-14rem)]" id="main">
<div class="flex flex-col w-full">
<!-- Top Welcome & Ticker Header -->
<section class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-gutter pt-space-xl pb-space-xl">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-space-lg">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-xl items-center">
<div class="lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-space-md justify-center">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">waving_hand</span><span class="">你好，欢迎光临我的数字秘密基地</span>
</div>
<h1 class="font-display text-primary leading-tight font-normal tracking-tight text-display-mobile sm:text-display">
                  沉迷网文修仙，在酷狗声浪里漫游现实与异次元。
                </h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
                  白天是穿梭于教室与自习室的大学生，夜晚是在网文世界修仙斩妖、在酷狗音乐里找回平静的数字漫游者。这里收纳了我追过的网文、循环的歌单，以及搜罗的动漫、现实与虚拟世界的画面。
                </p>
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-1">
