</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col justify-between gap-space-md bg-surface-container-low p-space-lg rounded-xl border border-surface-container-high/60 shadow-sm h-full" id="profile">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center font-headline-sm font-semibold shrink-0 shadow-sm">
                    屿
                  </div>
<div class="flex flex-col min-w-0">
<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
<span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary leading-none">岛屿同学</span><span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[0.625rem] font-label-sm bg-secondary text-on-secondary leading-none">在读大三</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1 truncate">普通大学生 / 杂食性生活观察者</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container p-space-md rounded font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                  “在充斥速食信息的节奏里，依然为几万字的网文高潮心潮澎湃，依然会在傍晚单曲循环酷狗里那首老歌。”
                </div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm pt-space-xs">
<a class="flex-1 py-2 bg-primary text-on-primary rounded text-center font-label-md text-label-md hover:bg-primary-container transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-1 shadow-sm" href="/guestbook/"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">forum</span><span class="">投递留言</span></a><a class="px-space-md py-2 bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface rounded font-label-md text-label-md hover:bg-surface-container transition-all text-center" href="#stats">数字存根</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="w-full bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg p-space-md shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-space-md">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-surface-container-high/70 px-space-sm py-1.5 rounded text-primary shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-on-tertiary-container animate-pulse">wifi_tethering</span><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm tracking-wider uppercase font-semibold">NOW / 状态广播</span>
</div>
<div class="flex-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-space-md gap-y-1 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant px-space-xs">
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-secondary">📖</span><span class="text-on-surface font-medium">追读网文：</span><span class="">《诡秘之主》· 愚者先生归来</span></span><span class="text-outline-variant hidden sm:inline">·</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-on-tertiary-container">🎵</span><span class="text-on-surface font-medium">酷狗单曲：</span><span class="">周深《大鱼》(蝰蛇全景声)</span></span><span class="text-outline-variant hidden lg:inline">·</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-secondary">🎨</span><span class="text-on-surface font-medium">最新灵感：</span><span class="">新海诚风天空插画 + 校园黄昏街拍</span></span>
</div>
<div class="text-on-surface-variant text-xs font-label-sm shrink-0 hidden xl:block pr-space-xs">
                刚刚更新
              </div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Four Highlight Feature Quadrants / Bento Grid -->
<section class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-gutter py-space-xl">
