<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">menu_book</span><span class="uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">网文书架 · Web Novel Shelf</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">追更中 · 第 841 章</span>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-12 gap-space-lg my-space-md items-center">
