<div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center text-on-secondary font-label-sm text-[0.625rem]">
                        KG
                      </div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 flex-1 justify-center">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-tertiary-container font-medium uppercase tracking-wider">酷狗正在播放</span><span class="text-[0.625rem] bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container px-1 rounded">Hi-Res无损</span>
</div>
<span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary truncate leading-tight mt-1">大鱼 (动画电影《大鱼海棠》印象曲)</span><span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant truncate mt-0.5">周深 · 酷狗热歌循环TOP1</span>
