<div class="space-y-1">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2 rounded hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors">
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-primary truncate">《起风了》· 买辣椒也用券</span><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant shrink-0">国语流行</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2 rounded hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors">
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-primary truncate">《打上花火》· 米津玄师 &amp; DAOKO</span><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant shrink-0">ACG动漫</span>
