                        从校园余晖到新海诚风天空
                      </p>
</div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary tracking-widest font-mono">58 张收录</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-space-xs">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm bg-surface-container px-space-xs py-0.5 rounded text-on-surface-variant">#动漫壁纸</span><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm bg-surface-container px-space-xs py-0.5 rounded text-on-surface-variant">#扫街胶片</span>
</div>
<a class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-tertiary-container hover:text-primary transition-colors flex items-center gap-1 font-medium" href="/photos/"><span class="">浏览完整相册</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xs">arrow_forward</span></a>
</div>
</article>
<article class="lg:col-span-7 bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl p-space-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between" id="notes">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-space-sm border-b border-surface-container-high">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary">
