                  </h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed line-clamp-3 mt-1">
                    白天在课堂和实验报告里被各种DDL推着往前跑，只有到了深夜，戴上耳机打开酷狗的蝰蛇音效，再点开最新更新的网文章节，那片波澜壮阔的世界才真正属于自己。网文不是逃避，而是给紧绷的现实搭起的一座避风港……
                  </p>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container p-space-md rounded-lg flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-space-sm mt-space-xs">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant italic">“用想象力对抗生活的琐碎平庸。”</span><a class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary hover:text-on-tertiary-container transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium" href="/essays/"><span class="">阅读随想全文</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">arrow_forward</span></a>
