<div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-md rounded-lg border border-surface-container-high/40 flex items-start gap-space-sm shadow-sm">
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center font-label-sm font-semibold shrink-0">
                  修
                </div>
<div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 flex-1">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-space-xs">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm font-medium text-primary">修仙考研人 (来自广州)</span><span class="font-label-sm text-[0.625rem] text-on-surface-variant">今天 14:20</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                    “同在二刷《诡秘之主》！酷狗里开着蝰蛇音效听《大鱼》看网文真是一绝，强烈安利你去听听周深的现场版，氛围感拉满。”
                  </p>
</div>
</div>
<form class="flex flex-col gap-space-md pt-space-xs" id="home-letter-form">
<input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" class="hidden" aria-hidden="true" />
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
<label class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant font-medium">称呼 / 笔名</label><input class="w-full bg-surface-container-low px-space-md py-2 rounded text-body-sm text-on-surface placeholder:text-on-surface-variant/50 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-secondary" placeholder="例：远方的夜行者" type="text" id="home-name" name="name"/>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
